# systemd journald message catalog for component: perf_scope

-- 9b2e5a11c4d74f08a6123e89f1b4d002
Subject: Failed to read or write component benchmark baseline file
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::perf_scope
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The perf_scope component could not read or write the baseline.json file in the
component's <name>BENCH directory. Verify file permissions and path validity.

-- 9b2e5a11c4d74f08a6123e89f1b4d003
Subject: Exception thrown during component benchmark measurement
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::perf_scope
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

An unexpected exception occurred while executing a benchmark workload inside
perf_scope::measure_workload and was caught by the Lippincott boundary handler.
